      "@id": "https://api.nuget.org/v3/catalog0/data/2026.05.01.00.07.34/modernmediator.idempotency.entityframework.2.2.0.json#deprecation/alternatePackage",
      "id": "ModernMediator",
      "range": "[2.1.0, )"
    },
    "message": "v2.2.0 has documented public-API contract issues on the assembly-scan registration path. HandlerErrorEventArgs is missing documented members (HandlerType, HandlerInstance), the unified Publish-path error policy does not fire under services.AddModernMediator(), and the MM201 dispatcher-prefix message is not emitted on overload mismatch. Use 2.1.0 until 2.2.1 ships.",
    "reasons": [
      "CriticalBugs"
    ]
  },
